stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> TicketOpened : Laptop handed in
    TicketOpened --> AwaitingEstimate : Estimate needed
    AwaitingEstimate --> TicketApproved : Owner agrees
    TicketOpened --> TicketApproved : Flat-rate fix
    TicketApproved --> Withdrawn : Owner declines or goes quiet
    TicketApproved --> Triage : Open, test, list parts
    Triage --> PartsIn : Parts ordered & delivered
    PartsIn --> Fixing : Technician begins
    Fixing --> Fixing : Further tweaks
    Fixing --> BurnIn : Repair done
    BurnIn --> Done : Runs stable
    BurnIn --> BurnInFailed : Crash, heat or noise
    BurnInFailed --> BurnIn : Tuned again
    BurnInFailed --> Parked : Part faulty again
    BurnInFailed --> VendorProblem : Wrong part shipped
    VendorProblem --> Fixing : Correct part in
    VendorProblem --> Parked : Part out of stock
    Parked --> BurnIn : Workaround applied
    Parked --> ReturnedAsIs : Owner takes it back
    Done --> [*]
    ReturnedAsIs --> Credited
    Withdrawn --> [*]
    Credited --> [*]
